flowchart LR
    Dev[Human / AI Developer]
    Branch[Short-lived Branch]
    PR[Pull Request]
    Review[Required Review / CODEOWNERS]
    PRCI[PR CI\nBuild + Tests + Security Gates]
    Main[Protected main]
    Build[Main Build]
    Artifact[Immutable Artifact\nVersion + Git SHA + Digest]
    SBOM[SBOM / Provenance / Attestation]
    Registry[(Approved Registry)]
    DevEnv[Development Environment]
    Stage[Staging Environment]
    Approval[Production Approval]
    Prod[Production Deployment\nExplicit Region / Deployment]
    Verify[Post-deploy Verification]
    Rollback[Rollback / Containment]

    Dev --> Branch --> PR
    PR --> Review
    PR --> PRCI
    Review --> Main
    PRCI -->|all required checks pass| Main
    Main --> Build --> Artifact
    Build --> SBOM
    Artifact --> Registry
    SBOM --> Registry

    Registry -->|same digest| DevEnv
    DevEnv -->|promote same digest| Stage
    Stage --> Approval
    Approval -->|GitHub OIDC / scoped AWS role| Prod
    Prod --> Verify
    Verify -->|failure| Rollback
    Rollback --> Registry

    Note1[No direct normal push to main]
    Note2[No long-lived AWS deployment keys]
    Note3[Do not rebuild per environment]
    Note4[AI may prepare; cannot self-approve production]

    Main -.-> Note1
    Approval -.-> Note2
    Stage -.-> Note3
    Approval -.-> Note4
